%% Sequence 08c — Resolve organization project detail
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: organization owner/admin opens one project detail in admin shell.
%% Evidence status: Implemented.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Organization owner / admin
    participant B as «boundary» Browser
    participant MW as «boundary» OrganizationResolverMiddleware
    participant C as «boundary» OrgShowProjectController
    participant F as «control» getProjectDetail()
    participant Q as «control» GetProjectDetailQuery
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL

    U->>B: Open project inside organization shell
    activate B
    B->>MW: GET /org/projects/:projectId
    alt Current organization context valid
        MW->>C: Forward request with organization context
        activate C
        C->>F: getProjectDetail(projectId, organizationId, actorContext)
        activate F
        F->>Q: handle(project detail DTO)
        activate Q
        Q->>D: Read project, access, members, roles, tasks and review summaries
        activate D
        D-->>Q: Project detail data or access failure
        deactivate D
        Q-->>F: Detail result
        deactivate Q
        F-->>C: Result
        deactivate F
        C-->>B: Render projects/show in organization shell
        deactivate C
    else Missing or invalid organization context
        MW-->>B: Redirect or access error
    end
    B-->>U: Show project or access error
    deactivate B
